VidDub release preparation snapshot, 2026-10-16.

This repository contains a reduced Wan2.1-VACE foundation derived from
Apache-2.0 DiffSynth-Studio. VidDub audio conditioning and causal VAE support
are integrated directly in that retained source subset. The upstream revision
and scope are recorded in dependencies/README.md.

The causal consistency adaptation includes a dedicated notice at
causal/cf/NOTICE. Model and dataset artifacts are distributed separately and
may be governed by additional upstream terms.
